    {'para': '**203.** Two nouns of relationship, ⟨svasṛ⟩ f., “sister”, and ⟨naptṛ⟩ m., ‘grandson’, follow this declension; but ⟨svasṛ⟩ makes the acc. pl. ⟨svasṝs⟩.'},
